flowchart TD
  Slow[Slow report query or sharing job] --> Q1{Filter selective and indexed?}
  Q1 -->|No| FixQ[Rewrite WHERE: positive, indexed, narrow; consider custom index]
  Q1 -->|Yes still slow| Q2{One owner over 10k?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Dist[Distribute ownership; avoid dummy user role moves]
  Q2 -->|No| Q3{Dummy parent with 10k plus children?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Split[Split children across real parents]
  Q3 -->|No| Arch[Archive old rows; reduce active volume]
